    {
      "content": "Fourth-graders’ pass rate:\n\n\\[\n\\frac{45}{100}=45\\%\n\\]\n\nFifth-graders’ pass rate is twice this:\n\n\\[\n2(45\\%)=90\\%\n\\]\n\nSo the number of fifth-graders who passed is:\n\n\\[\n0.90 \\times 400=360\n\\]\n\nIncluding third-graders, the total number who passed is:\n\n\\[\n340+45+360=745\n\\]\n\nThe total number of students is:\n\n\\[\n500+100+400=1000\n\\]\n\nTherefore, Herbert Hoover Elementary School’s overall pass rate is:\n\n\\[\n\\frac{745}{1000}\\times 100\\%=\\boxed{74.5\\%}\n\\]",
