  "task_assistant_messages": [
    "Step 1: Of the 100 fourth-graders, 45 passed, so  \n\\[\n100-45=55\n\\]\nfourth-graders failed.\n\nStep 2: Thus, \\(55\\%\\) of fourth-graders failed. However, no information is provided about the number of fifth-graders or how many of them failed.\n\nTherefore, the combined percentage cannot be determined from the given information.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Insufficient information}}\n\\]",
    "If 40 out of 100 fourth-graders passed, then:\n\n\\[\n100-40=60\n\\]\n\nSo, \\(60\\%\\) of the fourth-graders failed.\n\nHowever, no information is given about the fifth-graders, so the combined percentage for fourth- and fifth-graders cannot be determined.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Insufficient information}}\n\\]",
